    <title>VScode插件</title>
    <url>/2026/08/19/VScode%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6.html</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>自用VScode插件，有需要自取</p>
<h2 id="1-background">1.<a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=shalldie.background">background</a></h2>
<p>可以更换VScode的背景图，还能对不同的区域设置不同的背景图。</p>
<h2 id="2-CPH-NG">2.<a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=langningchen.cph-ng">CPH-NG</a></h2>
<p>下一代CPH，比CPH好用，专为OIER设计，有对拍，设置SPJ，测量时间空间等功能。</p>
<h2 id="3-Power-Mode">3.<a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=hoovercj.vscode-power-mode">Power Mode</a></h2>
<p>打代码的时候在光标处产生特效，整个代码产生抖动，有点像打音游。</p>
<h2 id="4-Thief-Book">4.<a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=C-TEAM.thief-book">Thief-Book</a></h2>
<p>摸鱼看书神器，可以上课看小说</p>
<h2 id="5-tldraw-Excalidraw">5.<a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=tldraw-org.tldraw-vscode">tldraw</a>/<a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=pomdtr.excalidraw-editor">Excalidraw</a></h2>
<p>两种不同的白板，可以画图</p>
<h2 id="6-Office-Viewer">6.<a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=cweijan.vscode-office">Office Viewer</a></h2>
<p>查看word，excel，ppt，pdf等文件，还附带一个类似typora的Markdown编辑器(但是有点缺陷)</p>
<h2 id="7-Markdown-Editor">7.<a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=zaaack.markdown-editor">Markdown Editor</a></h2>
<p>类似typora的Markdown编辑器(但是也有缺陷)</p>
<h2 id="8-vscode-icons">8.<a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=vscode-icons-team.vscode-icons">vscode-icons</a></h2>
<p>图标库</p>
]]></content>
      <tags>
        <tag>工具</tag>
      </tags>
